  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addendum 1 to FED/2020/419-614 - DELPAZ: Manica and Tete Sub-programme - Additional contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Additional EU contribution to the &apos;&apos;Local governance and local economic development for peace - DELPAZ: Manica and Tete Sub- programme &apos;&apos; that implements livelihoods recovery activities in districts of the Provinces of Manica and Tete. The programme complements two other contribution agreements under the same decision: a sister economic recovery programme in the Province of Sofala and a complementary local governance action.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
